  "notes": [
    "Haarlemmerweg 63-71 (pand 0363100012081533, built 1983): the western block of the same buff-brick social-housing scheme as Haarlemmerweg 77-87, on the Haarlemmerweg facing the Haarlemmervaart and the Westerpark.",
    "walls[0] the lower 14 m wing (panel 2, crop w01-359L 2021-03-22, square on): four storeys, a narrow and a wide white-framed window axis and a wide axis at the east end.",
    "walls[1] the taller west end (panel 11, crop w03-359 2025-06-18, square on): five storeys of brick to the top, a white-framed window axis at each edge, blank brick between.",
    "Wall colour #7d6b58 from the overcast 2021 crop (as Haarlemmerweg 77-87).",
    "NOT DRAWN (kit cannot say): the split-level window rows of the east axis of walls[0] (half a storey above the west axes); the glazed stair tower; the dark basement vent band; the windows' L-shaped frames with a low side light."
